30 arid summers had he seen. Those summers had dried up all his physical superfluousness,

10
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:50,679
but this his thinness, so to speak, seemed no more the token of wasting

11
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:55,956
anxieties and cares, then it seemed the indication of any bodily blight. It was

12
00:00:55,957 --> 00:01:00,918
merely the condensation of the man. He was by no means ill-looking, quite the

13
