31
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:36,438
ruggedness of his nature, and open him still further to those latent influences

32
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:42,839
which, in some honestarted men, restrain the gush of daredevil daring so often

33
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:47,956
against by others in the more perilous vicissitudes of the fisheries. I will

34
00:02:47,957 --> 00:02:54,438
have no man in my boat, said Starbucks, who is not afraid of a whale. By this he

35
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:58,918
seemed to mean not only that the most reliable and useful courage was that

36
00:02:58,919 --> 00:03:04,278
which arises from the fair estimation of the encountered peril, but that an

37
